		<title>OpenAI o1 co-creator Noam Brown urges promising students to drop out as AI enters a &quot;very steep rate of progress&quot;</title>
		<link>https://the-decoder.com/openai-o1-co-creator-noam-brown-urges-promising-students-to-drop-out-as-ai-enters-a-very-steep-rate-of-progress/</link>
					<comments>https://the-decoder.com/openai-o1-co-creator-noam-brown-urges-promising-students-to-drop-out-as-ai-enters-a-very-steep-rate-of-progress/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Maximilian Schreiner]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:58:44 +0000</pubDate>
