		<title>Anthropic researcher stands by his AI-assisted Riemann proof but owns up to &quot;stupid things&quot; in the rollout</title>
		<link>https://the-decoder.com/anthropic-researcher-stands-by-his-ai-assisted-riemann-proof-but-owns-up-to-stupid-things-in-the-rollout/</link>
					<comments>https://the-decoder.com/anthropic-researcher-stands-by-his-ai-assisted-riemann-proof-but-owns-up-to-stupid-things-in-the-rollout/#respond</comments>
		
